/*!
\page page_stFcsHit StFcsHit

\brief Raw tower hit in the STAR Forward Calorimeter System (FCS), including waveform data.

\section fcsHit_overview Overview

StFcsHit stores the digitised waveform and derived energy for a single tower
in the STAR FCS (Forward Calorimeter System, Run 22+).  The FCS has six
sub-detectors: ECAL North/South (ID 0/1), HCAL North/South (ID 2/3), and
Pre-shower North/South (ID 4/5).  The readout uses DEP boards; two packed
16-bit words (\c mDetId and \c mDepCh) encode the full detector address.

The waveform is stored as a TArrayS with 12-bit ADC samples plus 4-bit flag
bits.  In zero-suppressed mode each sample is paired with its time-bin index.

\section fcsHit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StFcsHit
\endcode

Stored in \ref page_stFcsCollection "StFcsCollection" (vector per sub-detector).

\section fcsHit_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| UShort_t | mDetId | Packed: bit15=ZS flag, bits14-12=sub-detector ID, bits11-0=channel ID. |
| UShort_t | mDepCh | Packed: bit15=NS, bits14-13=EHP, bits12-8=DEP board, bits7-0=channel. |
| UInt_t | mAdcSum | Sum of ADC over all time bins. |
| Float_t | mFitPeak | Fitted waveform peak position [time bins]. |
| Float_t | mFitSigma | Fitted Gaussian sigma [time bins]. |
| Float_t | mFitChi2 | Waveform fit χ². |
| UInt_t | mNPeak | Number of peaks in the waveform. |
| Float_t | mEnergy | Calibrated energy [GeV]. |
| TArrayS* | mData | Waveform samples (12-bit ADC + 4-bit flags). |
| StFcsCluster* | mCluster | Parent cluster (non-owning). |

\section fcsHit_subdets Sub-detector IDs

| ID | Description |
|---|---|
| 0 | ECAL North (W-Shashlyk, 22×34=748 ch) |
| 1 | ECAL South |
| 2 | HCAL North (Fe-scint, 13×20=260 ch) |
| 3 | HCAL South |
| 4 | Pre-shower North (16×12=192 ch) |
| 5 | Pre-shower South |

\section fcsHit_methods Key Methods

- \c detectorId() — sub-detector ID (0–5).
- \c id() — channel ID within the sub-detector.
- \c ns(), \c ehp(), \c dep(), \c channel() — DEP address fields.
- \c zs() — zero-suppression flag.
- \c nTimeBin(), \c adc(i), \c timebin(i), \c flag(i) — waveform access.
- \c adcSum(), \c fitPeak(), \c fitSigma(), \c fitChi2(), \c nPeak() — derived waveform quantities.
- \c energy() — calibrated energy [GeV].
- \c cluster() — parent cluster.
- \c print() — print summary.

\section fcsHit_seealso See Also

\ref page_stFcsCluster "StFcsCluster",
\ref page_stFcsPoint "StFcsPoint"
*/
